{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02252","headline":"杂曲歌辞 宫中行乐词 七 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 宫中行乐词 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒雪梅中尽，春风柳上归。\n宫莺娇欲醉，檐燕语还飞。\n迟日明歌席，新花艳舞衣。\n晚来移彩仗，行乐泥光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}